        zh = "帽檐很宽，承诺的生活却一直很窄。你戴着它站在废墟里，看上去像拥有整座牧场的人，只是牛、围栏和工资都已经提前退休。",
        en = "The brim is wide; your prospects are narrower. In the ruins, this hat makes you look like a ranch owner, provided nobody asks where the cattle, fences, or income went.",
