        en = "Ten solid liters of pure aluminum tipping the scales at 27 kilograms. In the old world, this would have become two thousand soda cans or half a lawn chair; today, it is a hernia-inducing promise to forge the wasteland's most indestructible frying pan.",
    },
    ["10l_brass"] = {
        zh = "闪烁着蒸气朋克狂热梦想的金黄色泽。八十四公斤的铜锌合金结块，足够给一整支末日军阀卫队复刻维多利亚时期的制服扣子，或者铸造一个绝对不会漏水但根本抬不走的豪华留声机大喇叭。",
        en = "Eighty-four kilograms of golden, steampunk ambition. That is enough copper-zinc alloy to craft ornamental buttons for an entire warlord brigade, or a monumental gramophone horn that nobody can lift without a forklift.",
