    ["10l_steel"] = {
        zh = "整整十升标准化结构钢，工业母机的食粮，现代骨骼的基石。当你把它安全运回安全屋的那一刻，你在废土上的身份就正式从“流浪拾荒乞丐”晋升为了“拥有工业库存的独居技术工人”。",
        en = "Ten liters of standardized structural steel: the bread and butter of human engineering. The moment you haul this into your basement, you are no longer a scavenger; you are an unauthorized industrialist.",
