    ["12_ammo_box_100"] = {
        zh = "整整一百发重装霰弹！纸箱沉重得让人眉开眼笑。只要把它端端正正放在走廊尽头的沙袋掩体上，即使是全镇的丧尸在你的防线前跳踢踏舞，你也能把它们全部请回棺材里。",
        en = "One hundred rounds of brutal spread. The box is heavy enough to strain your shoulders, but resting it atop a sandbag barricade turns any narrow hallway into a definitive argument against trespassing.",
