    ["12_ammo_box_5"] = {
        zh = "只有可怜巴巴的五发子弹。与其说是武装弹药，倒不如说是命运发给你的安慰奖：两发用来打门锁，两发用来解决追兵，剩下最后一发由你决定是留给自己还是留给上帝。",
        en = "A blister pack containing precisely five shells. That is two for the jammed padlocks, two for the rabid wolves, and one left over to facilitate an urgent philosophical conference with your creator.",
