        en = "A stainless steel .45-70 lever gun equipped with an oversized loop and XS ghost-ring sights. It famously starred in Jurassic World as a dinosaur stopper; in the cataclysm, levering a fresh cartridge into battery delivers pure cinematic dopamine.",
