    ["HEW_printout_data_portal"] = {
        zh = "一份关于“稳定传送门”的简报。“稳定”在物理学家的词典里只意味着它不会立刻向内坍缩成黑洞，至于它吐出异界怪物和毒气的稳定性，则完全不在保修范围内。",
        en = "A report on a 'stable portal.' To theoretical physicists, 'stable' merely signifies it won't instantly implode into a micro-black hole; its steady delivery of otherworldly monstrosities is considered working as intended.",
