    ["LIXA_lab_postit"] = {
        zh = "一张颜色鲜亮夺目的青色荧光便利贴。上面用潦草圆珠笔写着诸如提醒同事换咖啡滤纸的琐碎日常，在遍布干涸血迹与碎玻璃的生化实验台角落里显得尤为荒谬刺眼。",
        en = "A vibrant cyan sticky note scribbled with mundane workplace reminders about refilling breakroom coffee beans. Clinging stubbornly to shattered laboratory consoles amidst dried gore, it stands as a poignant relic of ordinary life.",
