    ["RPG_die"] = {
        zh = "经典的二十面骰子。旧时代它决定圣骑士能否暴击恶龙；新世界里一旦掷出大失败“1”，即便平地摔倒也能精准把脚踝送进丧尸嘴里。",
        en = "A classic twenty-sided die. In the old world it determined critical hits on dragons; in the apocalypse, rolling a '1' ensures you trip into an open zombie maw.",
