    ["book_nonf_hard_language_learning"] = {
        zh = "一本厚重的外语语法自学精装教材。曾经无数人发誓今年一定背完单词却从未翻过前三章，如今拿来学习异界生物或敌对流亡者部落的土著发音，竟然出奇地管用。",
        en = "A dense language primer once bought with optimistic New Year resolutions and abandoned on page ten. Repurposing its phonetic drills to decipher regional raider dialects proves unexpectedly useful.",
