    ["bottle_bathroom"] = {
        zh = "一只可以挤压的塑料洗手液空瓶。曾经装满了香气宜人的芦荟润肤洗手液，如今被幸存者洗干净用来灌装提炼出来的植物润滑油或者野外采集的驱蚊草药汁。",
        en = "A pliable plastic squeeze bottle once filled with scented bathroom hand soap. Cleaned thoroughly, scavengers refill it with clarified cooking tallow or herbal insect repellent for long scouting runs.",
