        en = "A sturdy hollow cardboard tube; ideal for spooling fine copper wire or packing with black powder to assemble crude, noisy diversion firecrackers.",
    },
    ["carding_paddles"] = {
        zh = "长满细密弯曲钢丝刷齿的木质梳毛板，双手配合反复刷拉，就能把纠结成团的脏羊毛梳理成蓬松顺直的毛条，等待纺车将其纺成毛线。",
        en = "A pair of toothy wooden paddles studded with wire bristles, teasing tangled raw sheep wool into airy, aligned rovings fit for drop spindles.",
