        en = "A flush floor hatch concealing a deep steel cargo compartment, transforming interior walking aisles into discreet storage lockers for illicit wasteland plunder.",
    },
    ["cargo_lock"] = {
        zh = "带有加厚锁舌与强化挂锁孔的重型车厢门锁套件，只要安装到位，就能让那些尾随你车辆的贪婪拾荒者对着焊死的车门无计可施。",
        en = "A hardened steel locking mechanism designed for vehicle hatches, preventing curious scavengers from raiding your mobile pantry while you sleep inside.",
