        en = "An exhaustive textbook on residential woodworking and framing, guiding illiterate post-collapse survivors through raising defensible cabins from fresh timber.",
    },
    ["carpet_armguards"] = {
        zh = "用旧化纤地毯卷在手臂上并用胶带缠死的自制护臂，虽然毛茸茸的外观极其滑稽，但那层厚实编织底背确实能挡住普通丧尸的撕咬。",
        en = "Coarse shag carpet rolled around forearms and taped tight; looks utterly absurd, but thick synthetic backing effectively thwarts casual dental punctures.",
