    ["eggnog"] = {
        zh = "浓郁顺滑的无酒精蛋奶羹；散发着肉桂与奶香的传统节日饮品，每一口都能勾起对战前温馨圣诞节的追忆，但缺乏酒精防腐的它在常温下变质得比丧尸咬人还快。",
        en = "Sweet, velvety eggnog rich with milk and fragrant nutmeg; a nostalgic holiday treat evoking cozy pre-war winters, though lacking alcohol preservation, it spoils into curdled food poisoning in a matter of hours.",
