    ["krar"] = {
        zh = "用坚硬木料与碗状共鸣箱手工制成的小型竖琴，弹奏出古老东非的高亢旋律。在荒凉无声的废土夜晚拨动琴弦，哪怕引来几只迷茫的丧尸，也胜过在死寂中发疯。",
        en = "A traditional five-stringed bowl lyre producing bright, evocative melodies from ancient highland traditions. Plucking its taut strings breaks the suffocating midnight silence, even if the jaunty tunes occasionally attract curious nocturnal predators.",
