    ["ksub2000"] = {
        zh = "能够对折收纳进背包的轻量化手枪口径卡宾枪，兼容极其泛滥的格洛克弹匣。它是侦察幸存者的梦中情枪，只要你不指望用这根纤细塑料枪托去硬砸丧尸的脑壳。",
        en = "A lightweight pistol-caliber carbine that hinges neatly in half to stow inside standard daypacks. It feeds reliably from ubiquitous handgun magazines, provided you never attempt to use its flimsy skeleton stock as a bludgeon.",
