    ["kufi"] = {
        zh = "编织紧密的无檐圆顶小白帽，透气舒适且充满传统庄重感。虽然它无法提供任何抵御丧尸利齿的护甲加成，但在烈日下赶路时，至少能保护头顶不被晒脱皮。",
        en = "A lightweight, closely knitted brimless cap offering modest comfort and breezy sun protection. Though it offers zero defensive armor against snapping zombie jaws, it keeps scorching summer glare from baking your exhausted scalp.",
