    ["kvass"] = {
        zh = "用黑麦面包发酵而成的低度微泡饮料，带有一丝酵母香与微酸的回甘。在连干净饮用水都充满辐射尘的废土，这罐泛着泡沫的面包水就是最接地气的琼浆玉液。",
        en = "A tangy, lightly fermented brew born from crusty rye bread scraps and clean spring water. When pristine tap water is an extinct luxury, this mildly fizzy staple keeps thirst away while delivering vital yeast nutrients.",
