    ["nutboltbat"] = {
        zh = "在球棒头部钻孔并拧入数十枚带螺母重型工业螺栓的重击棒球棍。每一次挥击都裹挟着可怕的角动量，沉重的螺栓棱角能把丧尸的颅骨像西瓜一样当场砸得四分五裂。",
        en = "A heavy ash bat drilled through with industrial steel bolts and locked nuts. The added angular mass crushes rotten craniums like ripe melons, delivering terrifying blunt trauma in tight quarters.",
