        en = "A heavy sheaf of freshly reaped oat stalks heavy with ripe grain. Hanging them inside dry smoking racks dries the crop for threshing, yielding bushels of golden grain that sustain farming communes.",
    },
    ["oatmeal"] = {
        zh = "经过蒸汽压扁处理的高品质干燥燕麦片。极其耐存放且容易消化，煮成浓稠热粥不仅能够为长途跋涉提供充沛耐力，在缺乏精细饲料时直接倒进马槽也是马匹最爱的力量源泉。",
        en = "Rolled dry oat flakes flattened for rapid cooking and superb shelf stability. Boiled into hearty morning porridge they provide enduring complex carbs, while dry scoops double as nutritious forage for pack horses.",
