    ["oatmeal_cooked"] = {
        zh = "在野营小铁锅中用沸水煮得温热软糯的经典燕麦粥。纯朴温热的麦香在空气中弥漫，饱腹感极强，是自北美拓荒时代起就滋养无数探险家与工业巨头的质朴高能美食。",
        en = "A steaming bowl of cooked oatmeal prepared over a field stove. Warm, nutritious, and deeply comforting, this New England staple has fueled rugged frontier pioneers and weary survivors through bitter, freezing mornings.",
