    ["oatmeal_deluxe"] = {
        zh = "在浓稠燕麦粥中豪爽地混入野生浆果、蜂巢蜂蜜与坚果仁的特级豪华燕麦料理。口感层次极为丰富，每一勺都充满了浓郁甜香与多重营养，是避难所大厨犒劳功臣的最高规格礼遇。",
        en = "A luxurious serving of oatmeal enriched with scavenged dried berries, honey, and chopped walnuts. Bursting with sweet flavor and wholesome calories, this deluxe breakfast turns a grim morning into a morale-boosting feast.",
