    ["oats"] = {
        zh = "一大堆刚刚脱壳筛洗干净的纯天然生燕麦颗粒。外壳坚韧防潮，是耐储存性极佳的基础粮种，既可以直接播种在肥沃黑土中期待丰收，也可以用石磨碾碎熬煮浓郁的麦糊。",
        en = "A generous pile of raw unrolled oat grains. Excellent for long-term food caches thanks to protective husks, they can be ground into coarse meal or planted in fertile soil for future sustainable harvests.",
