    ["paint_blue"] = {
        zh = "一罐色泽明亮澄澈如晴空般的纯蓝色防护油漆。在单调灰暗的废墟据点里粉刷墙面，不仅能防水防霉隔绝潮气，这抹亮丽的海蓝色还能给天天紧绷神经的幸存者带来仿佛面朝大海的宁静。",
        en = "A can of rich, ocean-blue weatherproofing paint. Coating the weathered wooden exterior of survival cabins prevents rot and dampness while providing a tranquil burst of sky-blue color that cheers demoralized pioneers.",
