    ["paint_cyan"] = {
        zh = "一罐鲜艳醒目的青色快干合成油漆。色调清爽而明亮，在末日据点内用来标记医疗站通道、危险化学品存放区或逃生出口，即使在昏暗的手电光柱照射下也能让人在百米外一眼看清路线。",
        en = "A tin of vibrant cyan synthetic paint formulated for fast drying. Its brilliant turquoise tint is ideal for color-coding emergency medical lockers and marking clear evacuation routes through murky subterranean tunnels.",
