    ["paint_pink"] = {
        zh = "一罐甜美娇嫩的亮粉色乳胶漆。在这片灰暗血腥、满目疮痍的末日废土，用它在钢铁战车或重机枪护盾上刷出一只粉色大猫，这种充满荒诞朋克风的反差审美能瞬间把掠夺者看懵在原地。",
        en = "A bucket of cheerful, unapologetic bright pink latex paint. Splattering this pastel shade across heavily armored gun trucks or sledgehammer heads brings glorious punk defiance that confuses aggressive raiders.",
