    ["paint_red"] = {
        zh = "一罐鲜艳如血的艳红色警示油漆。在被感染封锁的危房大门上刷上巨大的红十字与危险标志，不仅能警示贸然闯入的流浪汉，也能把自制改装皮卡涂成一辆令敌人闻风丧胆的狂暴血色战车。",
        en = "A can of vivid blood-red warning paint. Essential for stenciling biohazard crosses over quarantined doors or splashing intimidating war-stripes along spiked vehicle bumpers, it communicates absolute danger at a single glance.",
