    ["paintball"] = {
        zh = "一颗包裹着鲜艳水溶性染料的薄皮明胶彩弹。击中目标瞬间外壳破裂、泼洒出一大片无法抹去的亮色墨迹，在末日没有真枪实弹时用来进行巷战对抗演练，既安全又能检验射击身法。",
        en = "A spherical gelatin capsule filled with water-soluble colored dye designed for sporting markers. Exploding upon impact into a bright splash, it allows survivors to run non-lethal tactical urban combat drills safely.",
