    ["paintballgun"] = {
        zh = "利用小型压缩二氧化碳气瓶驱动的高射速半自动彩弹枪。虽然彩弹无法对皮糙肉厚的丧尸造成致命物理伤害，但密集的彩弹击打在怪物眼眶上能糊满颜料，瞬间致盲其追捕视线。",
        en = "A pneumatic marker powered by small CO2 cartridges that fires colorful paintballs in rapid bursts. While lacking lethal stopping power, splattering paint across zombie faceplates effectively blinds and confuses pursuing horrors.",
