    ["pan"] = {
        zh = "一口沉甸甸的传世铸铁平底煎锅。不仅能用来煎蛋烤肉炖野菜，在丧尸扑面而来的紧急时刻单手抡起锅底一拍，那声清脆的当啷巨响足以把变异怪物的脸打得深深凹陷。",
        en = "A heavy cast-iron skillet seasoned with layers of cooked grease. Beyond searing scavenged steaks, swinging this hefty slab of iron flattens approaching zombie faces with a resounding metallic clang.",
