    ["pan_roasted_corn"] = {
        zh = "在粗铁平底锅中用动物油脂、干辣椒粉与野生百里香大火翻炒至焦香金黄的盘烤玉米粒。玉米颗粒饱满多汁，每一口在齿间爆浆的同时散发着令人沉醉的烟熏香气，是极度美味的营地能量主粮。",
        en = "Tender sweet corn pan-fried over campfire embers with rendered lard, paprika, and wild thyme. Every charred, blistered kernel bursts with smoky sweetness, providing a nutritious and heartwarming meal that fuels hard physical labor.",
