    ["panacea"] = {
        zh = "一颗指甲盖大小、散发着苹果红温润光泽的万能胶囊。内部封存着战前顶级纳米医疗混合物，不论遭遇多严重的复合感染、致命毒素或辐射内伤，一口吞下都能彻底清除病灶挽回性命。",
        en = "An apple-red gel capsule packed with advanced pre-cataclysm pan-medical nanites. Capable of purging lethal radiation sickness, systemic infections, and virulent poisons in a single swallow, it is worth more than crates of assault rifles.",
