    ["pear"] = {
        zh = "一只形状饱满匀称、表皮金黄微带斑点的甘甜成熟洋梨。肉质细腻清脆且汁水极为丰盈，轻轻咬上一口，清凉甘冽的甜汁在口中爆开，是漫漫跋涉后最好的天然解渴生津果品。",
        en = "A crisp, bell-shaped pear ripe with sweet refreshing juice. Plump and firm under thumb pressure, its cool aromatic flesh provides delicious hydration that quenches thirst faster than lukewarm canteen water.",
