    ["pepperscrap"] = {
        zh = "用黑胡椒粗盐调味并炒熟的一小撮零碎肉末。虽然分量少得可怜，但香辣焦脆的口感配上一口冰凉的开水，足以给疲惫不堪的拾荒者带来片刻的慰藉与力量。",
        en = "Minced scraps of scavenged meat stir-fried with heavy black pepper. Though barely filling an empty stomach, its savory punch provides a quick morale lift before you return to scavenging.",
