        en = "A chunk of fresh raw meat butchered from wild fowl. While tender and rich in lean protein, consuming it raw invites agonizing food poisoning, demanding thorough campfire roasting before human consumption.",
    },
    ["poultry_cooked"] = {
        zh = "在营火铁签上烤至外皮金黄酥脆、内部肉汁四溢香气扑鼻的熟烤野禽肉。白嫩的鸡肉鲜嫩多汁且毫无油腻感，大快朵颐撕咬肉条咽下，能让长期啃干肉的幸存者感动得热泪盈眶。",
        en = "A juicy chunk of roasted poultry seared golden brown over glowing embers. Succulent, tender, and deeply nourishing, savoring this hot roast fowl restores physical vigor and lifts the spirits of weary hunters.",
    },
    ["poultry_pepper"] = {
        zh = "均匀抹满细磨黑胡椒碎与粗盐粒下锅煎烤的喷香椒盐烤禽肉。黑胡椒的微辣完全锁住了禽肉的鲜美原汁，一口咬下去鲜嫩爆汁且辛香开胃，是避难所大厨犒劳打猎勇士的最高规格硬菜。",
        en = "Seared poultry fillets crusted with freshly cracked black pepper and rock salt. The bold spicy aromatics seal in rich natural juices, turning simple wild game into an appetizing gourmet dinner that satisfies.",
