    ["poultry_scrap"] = {
        zh = "从变异火鸡骨架上剔除下来的零碎生禽肉末。虽然分量零星且夹杂着细碎的小骨茬，但只要扔进沸水锅里熬煮，依然能飘散出一股让人垂涎的真正鸡汤香气。",
        en = "Raw poultry trimmings scraped from mutant avian carcasses. Jagged bone fragments litter the meat, yet simmering these scraps produces authentic, soul-warming chicken broth that restores shivering scavengers.",
