    ["poultry_scrap_cooked"] = {
        zh = "在铁板上烤得滋滋作响的熟碎禽肉。外皮烤得微焦香脆，虽然几口就能咽下肚完全不顶饱，但在吃腻了寡淡野菜根的废土日常里，这点鸡肉油脂就是无上的美味犒劳。",
        en = "Minced poultry scraps pan-fried until crisped along the edges. It disappears down your throat in two bites, but the sizzling rendered chicken fat offers blissful relief from wild dandelion diets.",
