    ["power_cord"] = {
        zh = "一段外包厚实绝缘橡胶、内部含有三芯优质粗铜线的标准交流电源线。虽然插头两端在末日往往找不到通电插座，但剪断剥开内部的纯铜电线，是连接发电机与避难所电网的核心导线。",
        en = "A heavy-duty three-pronged electrical appliance cord insulated in thick synthetic rubber. Stripping away its outer casing yields pliable stranded copper conductors essential for wiring up generators, battery banks, and workbench lighting.",
