        en = "The legendary Soviet PPSh-41 submachine gun renowned for crude stamped-steel durability and an astonishing thousand-rounds-per-minute cycling rate. Firing 7.62x25mm rounds, spraying its cyclic fury tears advancing zombie swarms to tatters.",
