    ["ppshmag"] = {
        zh = "为波波沙冲锋枪特别研发的三十二或三十五发弧形冲压厚钢板弯弹匣。相比笨重卡壳易损的圆形大弹鼓，这种弧形香蕉弹匣携行轻便且供弹极其可靠，是二战老兵在残酷堑壕肉搏战中的最爱。",
        en = "A thirty-five round curved steel box magazine developed to replace cumbersome PPSh drums. Lighter, more reliable in mud, and faster to reload from web pouches, it keeps rapid-fire submachine guns agile in cramped quarters.",
