    ["retool_ump_45"] = {
        zh = "经典 .45 ACP 大口径 UMP 冲锋枪改装套件。硕大的沉重枪机有效降低了连发循环射速，让每一发亚音速胖子手枪弹都能平稳落入目标体内，砸出令人触目惊心的深邃血洞，近战之王。",
        en = "The quintessential .45 ACP conversion package for the HK UMP submachine gun. A heavy reciprocating bolt slows the cyclic rate into controllable thumps, delivering heavy subsonic lead that knocks charging ghouls flat on their backs.",
