    ["sourdough_young_uncovered"] = {
        zh = "刚用面粉和生水搅拌发酵一两天、尚未完全建立优势菌群的未成熟酸面种面糊。气味微酸中带着杂菌的生涩，微生物群落极度脆弱，需要继续耐心喂养与定期保温照看才能驯化成活。",
        en = "A juvenile sourdough starter blend that has only begun colonizing with airborne microbes. Fragile and exuding inconsistent sourness, it demands successive flour feedings before settling into a predictable baking culture.",
