    ["sourdough_young_uncovered_active"] = {
        zh = "正在顽强萌动、偶尔咕嘟冒出一个大气泡的幼年酸面团活性物。野生酵母正在与杂菌激烈争夺生存空间，虽然发酵力尚不足以撑起沉重面团，但预示着一罐新的生命发酵基底正在诞生。",
        en = "A young sourdough culture showing promising signs of active microbial life. With budding yeast cells multiplying steadily through flour slurry, it marks the successful genesis of a dependable home sourdough culture.",
