    ["sunscreen"] = {
        zh = "装在挤压塑料瓶内的 SPF 50+ 高倍数防晒护肤乳霜。涂抹在面部与手臂上能在皮肤表面形成一道反射紫外线的氧化锌保护膜，彻底阻止烈日暴晒引发的红肿起泡、严重日光灼伤与皮肤癌变。",
        en = "A bottle of broad-spectrum SPF 50+ sunscreen lotion compounding zinc oxide and moisturizing oils. Forming a barrier against searing ultraviolet radiation, it prevents agonizing blistered burns during grueling summer treks.",
