    ["suppressor"] = {
        zh = "采用高耐热钛合金外壳与内置多室精密膨胀挡板的步枪消音器。能将狂暴出膛的超音速火药燃气层层减速降温，把震耳欲聋的步枪枪声削减为沉闷的机械撞击，是潜行暗杀巡逻的消音神器。",
        en = "A rugged titanium rifle suppressor packed with precision heat-resistant expansion baffles. Bleeding off blistering muzzle gas volumes, it drops deafening gunshots to discreet thuds, preventing hordes from swarming.",
