    ["suppressor_compact"] = {
        zh = "体型小巧轻便、带有尼龙垫圈缓冲的手枪专用紧凑型消音器。安装在螺纹枪管前端绝不影响滑套闭锁与手枪重心指向，在逼仄室内射杀变异怪物时能保持静默，绝不惊动隔壁房间的沉睡尸潮。",
        en = "A lightweight, low-profile pistol suppressor designed for compact sidearms. Preserving cycle timing and natural pointing balance, it muffles handgun reports, allowing quiet room clearances without alerting neighboring nests.",
