    ["survivormap"] = {
        zh = "由多位历经浩劫的资深流浪拾荒者用铅笔与防水墨水联合手绘的宝贵羊皮纸地图。上面密密麻麻标注着清泉水源点、已搜刮废墟、变异巢穴与隐秘地下掩体入口，是废土行者的生死罗盘。",
        en = "A weathered hand-drawn regional survival map marked with annotations from multiple veteran scavengers. Pinpointing clean natural springs, booby-trapped caches, and subterranean fallout shelters, it navigates wanderers safely around death zones.",
