    ["survnote"] = {
        zh = "撕在一张发黄包装纸上的幸存者潦草求生笔录。上面用烧焦的炭条记录着附近几个地下水井的方位与尸群游荡的规律，是前人冒着用生命换来的无价废土生存路标。",
        en = "A weathered survival note scribbled in charcoal across a greaseproof paper wrapper. Detailing clean well locations and zombie patrol habits, its brief words guide cautious nomads through fatal urban traps.",
