        en = "A heavy-duty industrial caster wheel featuring a thick polyurethane tire on a cast-iron core. Capable of bearing enormous loads, it allows lone survivors to glide multi-ton tool chests across concrete workshop floors.",
    },
    ["wheel_metal"] = {
        zh = "完全由生铁或重型铸钢浇铸一体成型的全金属硬质车轮。虽然缺乏橡胶减震导致在颠簸路面行驶时震耳欲聋，但它永远不会被碎玻璃扎破或被火焰烧毁，是末日蒸汽战车最可靠的铁脚。",
