    ["xs_boots_chitin"] = {
        zh = "用甲虫外壳与坚韧皮革拼接而成的小号昆虫靴。轻若无物且坚硬抗砸，娇小的潜行者穿上它在走廊里飞奔时，落地声音轻柔得宛如一只真正的甲虫在爬行。",
        en = "Blending beetle carapace with supple leather, these miniature chitin boots feel featherlight. Petite runners sprinting down abandoned hallways produce barely a rustle, moving like giant beetles.",
